- Strict-Transport-Security
- Content-Security-Policy
- X-Content-Type-Options
- Referrer-Policy
- Permissions-Policy

Use appropriate values for the actual deployment. Do not add a policy that breaks required images, fonts, form submissions or navigation without testing it.

Do not claim a complete security audit based solely on a source-code scan. State which hosting, credential-history and runtime checks remain necessary.

